<span style="font-size: 12px; color: #5A6072; line-height: 1.5">Activating creates the organisation's isolated workspace and sends the invitations. The program version is recorded with the assignment.</span>
</div>
</div>
</sc-if>
</div>

<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-top: auto; padding: 16px 26px; border-top: 1px solid #EEF0F4; background: #FBFBFD; border-radius: 0 0 18px 18px">
